OL,3,GNEWSAInquiry may have stopped Legacy
OL,4,Ascandal, mum says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother who was wrongly told there
OL,7,Fwere no ashes to bury after her baby
OL,8,Fwas cremated said a public inquiry
OL,9,Fmight have prevented a later scandal at
OL,10,Fthe Legacy funeral home in Hull.
OL,12,FTina Trowhill was one of 57 families
OL,13,Fwho were not given their child's
OL,14,Fremains more than a decade ago by Hull
OL,15,FCity Council.
OL,17,FThe bereaved families were told no
OL,18,Fremains were left after cremations.
OL,19,FHowever, an internal investigation by
OL,20,Fthe council in 2017 found "ashes were
OL,21,Falways produced".
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
