OL,3,GNEWSAInquiry may have stopped Legacy
OL,4,Ascandal, mum says
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrowhill said if a public inquiry had
OL,7,Fbeen held then, "it may have identified
OL,8,Fsome of the issues and Legacy may not
OL,9,Fhave gone on for as long as it did or
OL,10,Fhappen".
